cat << 'EOF' > .env.example
# Gateway Configuration
PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=development

# RabbitMQ Message Broker
RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://guest:guest@localhost:5672
ANALYSIS_QUEUE_NAME=code_analysis_queue

# Internal Microservice URLs
CPP_ENGINE_URL=http://localhost:8080
PYTHON_AI_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Database & AI Keys
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/algosBehindAlgo
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
EOF

cat << 'EOF' > README.md
# algosBehindAlgo — Backend Monorepo

Event-driven polyglot backend that uses classic Data Structures & Algorithms in C++20 and GenAI in Python to analyze code complexity, call-graph dependencies, dead code, and structural similarity.

## Architecture
- **`gateway-node/`**: Node.js + TypeScript API Gateway & RabbitMQ Producer
- **`engine-cpp/`**: C++20 DSA Microservice (Kahn's Topological Sort, Control-Flow BFS/DFS, Rabin-Karp Rolling Hash)
- **`ai-python/`**: Python FastAPI + Gemini Worker for adversarial edge-case generation
- **`shared/`**: Message queue schemas & infrastructure configs
EOF